###  https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/PhysicalEssence
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/PhysicalEssence> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                 rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/PhysicalEssenceOrOccurrent> ;
                                                 rdfs:label "physical essence" ;
                                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Semantic mixin concept.  Pertains to entities that have physical properties such as mass, volume, or charge." ;
                                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model> .


###  https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/PhysicalEssenceOrOccurrent
<https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/PhysicalEssenceOrOccurrent> rdf:type owl:Class ;
